  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Important note:\n- This package replaces GrapeCity.Documents.Word, and provides the same functionality, ensures future enhancements, and is backwards compatible with GrapeCity.Documents.Word. Existing subscriptions will continue to apply to this new package.\n\n# Changes since version 8.1.0:\n\n## Fixed\n- IndexFieldOptions.CharacterRange property is case-sensitive (should be case-insensitive). (DOC-6875, DOC-6883)\n- Issues with handling of XeFieldOptions when the entry includes multiple pages. (DOC-6876, DOC-6882, DOC-6880)\n- A paragraph with a custom style with outline level different from OutlineLevel.BodyText is not included into the TOC by default. (DOC-6892)\n- System.NullReferenceException is thrown when generating TOC for a specific document. (DOC-6887)",
